      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "1. Submit puzzle; receive job_id\n2. Query job status + result\n3. Cancel an in-flight job\n4. Return one valid fill, UNSAT, TIMED_OUT,\n   CANCELLED, or FAILED\n5. Pin immutable dictionary version per job",
