      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789872395602,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 30,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "5. Deep dive — three NFR-critical directions, two options each",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5. Deep dive — three NFR-critical directions, two options each",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "t71",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 35,
      "y": 1440,
      "width": 337.4798583984375,
      "height": 32.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f1f1f",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 976460290,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 2058317202,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789872395602,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 26,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "A. Solver latency / pruning",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A. Solver latency / pruning",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "t72",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 35,
      "y": 1485,
      "width": 399.5126953125,
      "height": 285,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f1f1f",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2032525911,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1807190289,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789872395602,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Option 1 — naive DFS + scan dictionary\n• simple; low index memory\n• repeated scans explode on hard puzzles\n\nOption 2 — chosen\n• length/position/letter bitmap indexes\n• MRV + degree + LCV\n• forward checking / arc consistency\n• trail/delta rollback; local nogood cache\n\nTrade-off: more RAM + solver complexity,\nmuch lower branching factor / tail latency.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Option 1 — naive DFS + scan dictionary\n• simple; low index memory\n• repeated scans explode on hard puzzles\n\nOption 2 — chosen\n• length/position/letter bitmap indexes\n• MRV + degree + LCV\n• forward checking / arc consistency\n• trail/delta rollback; local nogood cache\n\nTrade-off: more RAM + solver complexity,\nmuch lower branching factor / tail latency.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "t73",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 905,
      "y": 1440,
      "width": 490.90576171875,
      "height": 32.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f1f1f",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1211973029,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1008376584,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789872395602,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 26,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "B. Correctness + completion semantics",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "B. Correctness + completion semantics",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "t74",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 905,
      "y": 1485,
      "width": 454.11865234375,
      "height": 308.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f1f1f",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2055788918,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 142072579,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789872395602,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Option 1 — exactly-once distributed execution\n• attractive in theory\n• complex coordination; still needs crash handling\n\nOption 2 — chosen\n• at-least-once subtree tasks + lease\n• stable branch ID / idempotent completion\n• verifier + compare-and-set first solution\n• cancel siblings after winner\n• UNSAT only when every disjoint branch closes\n\nTrade-off: occasional duplicate CPU for simpler,\nrecoverable correctness.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Option 1 — exactly-once distributed execution\n• attractive in theory\n• complex coordination; still needs crash handling\n\nOption 2 — chosen\n• at-least-once subtree tasks + lease\n• stable branch ID / idempotent completion\n• verifier + compare-and-set first solution\n• cancel siblings after winner\n• UNSAT only when every disjoint branch closes\n\nTrade-off: occasional duplicate CPU for simpler,\nrecoverable correctness.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "t75",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1775,
      "y": 1440,
      "width": 387.8678283691406,
      "height": 32.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f1f1f",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 969724223,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 256447509,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789872395602,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 26,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "C. Isolation / hard-job scaling",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "C. Isolation / hard-job scaling",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "t76",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1775,
      "y": 1485,
      "width": 455.1446533203125,
      "height": 308.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f1f1f",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 637409410,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 477996665,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789872395602,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Option 1 — one global FIFO worker queue\n• simple and high utilization\n• head-of-line blocking; one tenant can dominate\n\nOption 2 — chosen\n• weighted-fair tenant queues\n• separate normal vs hard-job pools\n• per-job CPU/wall/memory/task budget\n• split only coarse search subtrees\n• cap parallelism; autoscale on queued CPU time\n\nTrade-off: scheduler complexity for predictable\nP95, fairness, and bounded spend.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Option 1 — one global FIFO worker queue\n• simple and high utilization\n• head-of-line blocking; one tenant can dominate\n\nOption 2 — chosen\n• weighted-fair tenant queues\n• separate normal vs hard-job pools\n• per-job CPU/wall/memory/task budget\n• split only coarse search subtrees\n• cap parallelism; autoscale on queued CPU time\n\nTrade-off: scheduler complexity for predictable\nP95, fairness, and bounded spend.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
